29 CD DEP-020~ DEP-004~ m=MN k=P st=S | DEP-004 requires checking deprecation and DEP-020 treats direct Polly as an exception, but neither forbids these packages outright. The check is an ERROR with no approval path.
  x: Microsoft.Extensions.Http.Polly and Polly.Extensions.Http are hard errors
  s: A legacy project deliberately keeps Polly.Extensions.Http after checking its deprecation: the oracle does not forbid it; M1's checker reports an ERROR.
30 CD DEP-004~ DEP-021~ m=MN k=P st=S | Same pattern for a named deprecated sink.
  x: Serilog.Sinks.Elasticsearch is a hard error
  s: A project keeps this sink after the deprecation check for an existing cluster: the oracle does not forbid it; M1's checker reports an ERROR.
31 CD DEP-010~ m=MN k=P st=S | DEP-010 makes FluentValidation the standard library and does not address this integration package.
  x: FluentValidation.AspNetCore is a hard error
  s: A project adds FluentValidation.AspNetCore for pipeline validation: DEP-010 is satisfied; M1's checker reports an ERROR.
32 CO DEP-020 c=M | Restates DEP-020. 'Documented' sets no separate duty here beyond the explicit exception.
