39 CD DEP-003~ m=M k=W st=S c=M | The prerelease warning restates DEP-003. The floating-version error has no explicit-request branch (detail at FG-M1-a740c4fdf7).
  x: floating versions are errors even when explicitly requested
  s: The user explicitly requests "*" for a dev tool: DEP-003 allows it; M1's checker reports an ERROR.
40 CD DEP-003 m=MN k=W st=S | Same reading as calibration. '*' or empty versions are ERROR with no explicit-request branch; range specifiers are not flagged, so the check is narrower than DEP-003 there.
  x: '*' or empty NuGet/npm versions (and npm 'latest'/x) are checker errors even when the user explicitly requested a floating version
  s: The user explicitly requests "*" for a dev tool: DEP-003 allows it; the M1 checker reports an ERROR owned by add-dependency.
  fhd: Whether a checker should honour DEP-003's explicit-request exception for floating versions.
